  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "q1",
      "number": 1,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Prefix/Infix/Postfix Notation",
        "zh": "前缀／中缀／后缀表达式"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Evaluate the following postfix expression if all numbers are single digits:\n\n`9 3 * 9 2 3 ^ - + 8 1 - /`",
        "zh": "假设所有数字均为单个数字,请计算以下后缀表达式的值:\n\n`9 3 * 9 2 3 ^ - + 8 1 - /`"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "0",
            "zh": "0"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "2",
            "zh": "2"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "4",
            "zh": "4"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "6",
            "zh": "6"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "8",
            "zh": "8"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "C"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **C**.\n\n`9 3 * 9 2 3 ^ - + 8 1 - /`\n\n= ((9 * 3) + (9 − 2 ^ 3)) / (8 − 1) = (27 + (9 − 8)) / 7 = (27 + 1) / 7 = 28 / 7 = 4",
        "zh": "答案：**C**。\n\n沿后缀顺序先得 $9\\times3=27$、$2^3=8$，继而 $9-8=1$，相加得 28。后半段 $8-1=7$ 是分母，所以 $28/7=4$。"
      },
      "source": {
