        "zh": "前缀／中缀／后缀表达式"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Convert the following infix expression to prefix:\n\n$$\n\\frac{4+6^2-5}{8}+7\\cdot 2\n$$",
        "zh": "请将以下中缀表达式转换为前缀表达式:\n\n$$\n\\frac{4+6^2-5}{8}+7\\cdot 2\n$$"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "`/ + - + 4 ^ 6 2 5 8 * 7 2`",
            "zh": "`/ + - + 4 ^ 6 2 5 8 * 7 2`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "`+ / - + 4 ^ 6 2 5 8 * 7 2`",
            "zh": "`+ / - + 4 ^ 6 2 5 8 * 7 2`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "`+ / + - 4 ^ 6 2 5 8 * 7 2`",
            "zh": "`+ / + - 4 ^ 6 2 5 8 * 7 2`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "`+ / - + 4 ^ 6 2 * 5 8 7 2`",
            "zh": "`+ / - + 4 ^ 6 2 * 5 8 7 2`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "`+ / - + ^ * 4 6 2 5 8 7 2`",
            "zh": "`+ / - + ^ * 4 6 2 5 8 7 2`"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "B"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **B**.\n\n$$\n\\frac{4+6^2-5}{8}+7\\cdot 2\n$$\n\n= (4 + 6 ^ 2 − 5) / 8 + 7 * 2 = (4 + (^ 6 2) − 5) / 8 + (* 7 2) = ((+ 4 (^ 6 2)) − 5) / 8 + (* 7 2) = (− (+ 4 (^ 6 2)) 5) / 8 + (* 7 2) = (/ (− (+ 4 (^ 6 2)) 5) 8) + (* 7 2) = + (/ (− (+ 4 (^ 6 2)) 5) 8) (* 7 2) = + / − + 4 ^ 6 2 5 8 * 7 2",
        "zh": "答案：**B**。\n\n外层是加法。左边分子 $4+6^2-5$ 中加减同级，从左向右，写成 `- + 4 ^ 6 2 5`，再用 8 作除数。右边写成 `* 7 2`，两部分前放加号，得到 `+ / - + 4 ^ 6 2 5 8 * 7 2`。"
      },
